---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | Fate Apothecary" description="Privacy information for Fate Apothecary.">
  <section class="simple-page shell shell-standard">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>We keep this simple.</h1>

    <p>
      Fate Apothecary does not require an account to browse recipes, herb information, garden notes, or other public content.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you choose to contact us through the website, we use the name, email address, subject, and message you provide only to receive and respond to your message. We do not sell the information you submit through the contact form.
    </p>

    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to understand how people use Fate Apothecary—for example, which pages are visited, how visitors find the site, and general device or browser information. Google Analytics may use cookies or similar identifiers to provide these measurements. This helps us understand what is useful and improve the site.
    </p>

    <p>
      Payments made through the Support page are processed by Square. Fate Apothecary does not receive or store your full payment-card information.
    </p>

    <p>
      Some product and resource links may be affiliate links. If you make a purchase through one of those links, Fate Apothecary may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.
    </p>

    <p>
      Like most websites, our hosting provider may process basic technical information needed to deliver and protect the site, such as IP address, browser information, and request logs.
    </p>

    <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated October 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
